  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="9.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 9.1</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="9.1" corresp="#wit-q"><pb n="236" ed="#liebermann"/>Et illi habeant suboperarios suos in suo crimine, quod purum faciant et recti ponderis, per eandem witam quam prediximus.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="9.1" corresp="#wit-q"><pb n="76" ed="#robertson"/>Et illi habeant suboperarios suos in suo crimine, quod purum faciant et recti ponderis, per eandem witam quam praediximus.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann"><pb n="237" ed="#liebermann"/>Und diese sollen ihre Unterarbeiter unter ihrer Verantwortung [dafür] halten, dass sie reines [Geld] und richtigen Gewichtes herstellen, bei derselben Strafe, die wir oben genannt haben.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And let these hold their under-workers under their own responsibility [to ensure] that they produce pure [money] of correct weight, on the same penalty that we named above.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-q"><pb n="77" ed="#robertson"/>And they shall be responsible for the production by their employees of pure money of the proper weight, under pain of incurring the same fine<ptr type="editorNote" n="1" target="#IVAtr_9-1.robnote.n.1"/> as we have fixed above.</ab>
        <note type="comparison" source="#liebermann" n="237"><ref target="clause:IVAtr_5-3">IV Atr 5.3f.</ref></note>
        <note type="comparisonPrinted" source="#liebermann">Vgl. 5, 3 f.</note>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares IV Atr 5.3 f.</note>
        <note type="editorNote" subtype="endnote" xml:id="IVAtr_9-1.robnote.n.1" n="1" source="#robertson"><bibl><biblScope unit="page">326</biblScope></bibl><seg type="original" xml:lang="en"><hi rend="italic">i.e.</hi> in 7, 1?</seg></note>
      </div>
    </body>
